  "prefLabel": "Cub 103.04 Media Access",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 103.04 Media Access.\n\n(a) Board meetings shall be open to the print and electronic media.\n\n(b) The chairperson or a designee shall limit the activity of the print and electronic media to avoid disruption by:\n\n(1) Limiting the placement of television cameras to specific locations in the room where the board meeting is being held; and\n\n(2) Prohibiting interviews from being conducted within the room during the board meeting.\n\nSource. #12857-A eff 8-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
